<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were unchanged at</p>
<p>the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The three-mth</p>
<p>rate was flat at 3.14 pct.</p>
<p>				    August 15 fix    August 14 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.14 pct		3.14 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.34 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.51 pct		3.51 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.72 pct		3.72 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 292, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
